  "description": "Fast UI/UX review loop. Puts the screenshots, screens and components you choose into a per-project review lab styled like the project, lets the user approve or ask for changes, comment and mark areas, and returns that feedback straight to the session, round after round. Captures screenshots with the installed Chrome, keeps itself clean, and works in local, remote and cloud sessions. Use when the user asks to review, preview, QA or give feedback on UI, screens, components or visuals, or says \"preview lab\", \"review lab\" or \"visual review\". Two modes, visual (default) and complete (beta, adds UX, UI and accessibility recommendations).",
